desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "源码匹配：检测到 JFrog Artifactory 凭据"
	title_zh: "检测到 JFrog Artifactory 凭据"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "source-detected-artifactory-password"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 JFrog Artifactory 相关的硬编码凭据。本规则合并了 4 类凭据检测：Artifactory 密码、Artifactory 令牌、JFrog API 密钥、JFrog 身份令牌。凭据提交到仓库后，任何获取源码的人都能直接使用。

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问 JFrog Artifactory 服务。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合 JFrog Artifactory 凭据格式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-798
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量或密钥管理服务（如 Vault、云厂商 KMS/HSM）提供凭据，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
artifactoryx:_password=AP6abc1231321
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-detected-artifactory-password
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-artifactory-token
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-jfrog-api-key
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-jfrog-identity-token
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
integrity sha512-AP1AyUTbi2szylgr+O0OB7gkIxEGzySLITZ2GpsaoX72YMCGI2jYAc+WUhPfvUnZYiauF4zTnN4V4TGuvFjJlw==
ImageID: "SHA256:AP1AyUTbi2szylgr266fcae00707e67a2545ef34f9a29354585f93dac906749"
X-JFrog-Art-Api: $PASSWORD
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/\bAP[\dABCDEF][a-zA-Z0-9]{8,}|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-detected\-artifactory\-password/) as $p1_0
${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i).*arti[-_]?factory.*/) as $p2_0
$p1_0 & $p2_0 as $p3_0
${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i).*sha(1|2|3|118|256|512).*|(?s)-----BEGIN.*-----/) as $p4_0
$p3_0 - $p4_0 as $p5_0
${*}.pattern_regex(/(\w|\.|\*)\1{4}/) as $p6_0
$p5_0 - $p6_0 as $hit_0
alert $hit_0 for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 Artifactory 密码",
	title_zh: "检测到 Artifactory 密码",
	message: "检测到 Artifactory 密码",
}

${*}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:\bAKC[a-zA-Z0-9]{10,}\n)|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-artifactory\-token/, /sha(128|256|512).*\n/, /(?s)---BEGIN.*---\Z/) as $p0_1
$p0_1 as $hit_1
alert $hit_1 for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 Artifactory 令牌",
	title_zh: "检测到 Artifactory 令牌",
	message: "检测到 Artifactory 令牌",
}

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:(?i)(?:jfrog|artifactory|bintray|xray)(?:[0-9a-z\-_\t .]{0,20})(?:[\s|']|[\s|"]){0,3}(?:=|>|:{1,3}=|\|\|:|<=|=>|:|\?=)(?:'|\"|\s|=|\x60){0,5}([a-z0-9]{73})(?:['|\"|\n|\r|\s|\x60|;]|$))|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-jfrog\-api\-key/) as $p0_2
$p0_2 as $hit_2
alert $hit_2 for {
	level: "low",
	title: "检测到 JFrog API 密钥",
	title_zh: "检测到 JFrog API 密钥",
	message: "检测到 JFrog API 密钥",
}

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:(?i)(?:jfrog|artifactory|bintray|xray)(?:[0-9a-z\-_\t .]{0,20})(?:[\s|']|[\s|"]){0,3}(?:=|>|:{1,3}=|\|\|:|<=|=>|:|\?=)(?:'|\"|\s|=|\x60){0,5}([a-z0-9]{64})(?:['|\"|\n|\r|\s|\x60|;]|$))|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-jfrog\-identity\-token/) as $p0_3
$p0_3 as $hit_3
alert $hit_3 for {
	level: "low",
	title: "检测到 JFrog 身份令牌",
	title_zh: "检测到 JFrog 身份令牌",
	message: "检测到 JFrog 身份令牌",
}
